      "@type": "cat-harness:Tool",
      "description": "Render every reference in the checkout (each declared `references` directory's folio-reference/v1 nodes and each `catalogue` directory's Dublin Core records) as the bibliography page and one page per sub-graph, each with its BibTeX, CSL-JSON, RIS and Dublin Core JSON-LD exports and a per-reference export, at the route of the visualiser core declares for it.",
      "install": {
        "none": true
      },
